note right of Project
  Invariantes:
  - code único, formato NNNBR-MMM-AAAA (ej. 862BR-AGO-2026)
  - budget = base imponible sin IGV, > 0
  - participation: 1.0 propio / 0.5 compartido (Linings)
  - suma de progressRecords <= 100%; un registro por Period
  - solo IN_PROGRESS admite avance
  - al llegar a 100% -> COMPLETED + ProjectCompletedEvent
  salesCommission(igvRate) =
    budget x (1 + igvRate) x salesCommissionRate
  El costo REAL no vive aquí: lo calcula reporting
  desde expenses (por projectId).
end note

note right of ProjectCode
  Regex: ^\d{3}BR-(ENE|FEB|MAR|ABR|MAY|JUN|
  JUL|AGO|SEP|OCT|NOV|DIC)-\d{4}$
  Evita errores del Excel como
  "8789R-OCT-2026" o "853BRJUN-2026".
end note

note bottom
  The REST controllers delegate client and project use cases to application services.
  Project is the aggregate root for its progress records and cost estimates
  (@OneToMany cascade ALL, orphanRemoval). Other bounded contexts read projects only
  through ProjectsContextFacade and reference them by projectId (Long).
end note
@enduml
